      "description": "COLREG 72 is a complete study and reference app for the International Regulations for Preventing Collisions at Sea (COLREGs). Designed for maritime students, merchant navy officers, yacht skippers, and anyone preparing for an MCA, RYA, or international maritime examination.\n\nWHAT IS INCLUDED\n\n- Full text of all 72 COLREG rules (Annexes I through IV)\n- Theory study with illustrations\n- Navigation lights identification quizzes\n- Rule-based tests with answer explanations\n- Exam mode — a timed mock examination across all the rules with a final score and a full mistake review\n- Cross-references between rules and theory — open in popup overlays so you never lose your place\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nTheory and rules are linked throughout the app. When you answer a quiz question incorrectly or open a hint, a direct link appears to the exact theory section that covers the topic. Review the rule, then return to the quiz.\n\nThe app tracks which theory sections you have read, so you always know where you left off and what still needs attention.\n\nEXAM MODE\n\nSimulate the real examination. The exam is timed and draws questions from across all the rules. When time runs out, you get a clean result screen with your score and every mistake listed. Tap a wrong answer to see the explanation, the original comment from the question card, and a direct link to the relevant rule — so every attempt teaches you something.\n\nREADING\n\nReading is fully customisable: choose from multiple font types, adjust the font size, and switch between three colour themes — light, sepia, and dark — for comfortable study in any lighting condition. Layouts are tuned for both iPhone and iPad.\n\nWHO IT IS FOR\n\n- Maritime students at nautical colleges and academies\n- Merchant navy officers preparing for OOW, Chief Mate, or Master examinations\n- Yacht skippers and RYA Day Skipper / Yachtmaster candidates\n- Coastal and offshore sailors who need a reliable collision avoidance reference\n- Anyone sitting an MCA, MNI, or international maritime authority examination\n\nWHY COLREG 72\n\nInternational collision avoidance regulations are the foundation of safe navigation at sea. Whether you are studying for the first time or refreshing your knowledge before an examination, this app gives you the full text, visual aids, practice tests, and a realistic exam mode to build true confidence.\n\nOne-time purchase. No subscription. No ads. Study offline, anytime.\n\nDownload COLREG 72 and arrive at your examination prepared.",
